@startuml

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2E86AB
    LifeLineBorderColor #2E86AB
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
    ParticipantBorderColor #2E86AB
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9E6
    BorderColor #2E86AB
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam box {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2E86AB
}

title VCS Workflow: User Edits to Preview

' ========================================
' Participants
' ========================================

actor "User" as User
participant "Local Git" as LocalGit
participant "SSH Server" as SSH
participant "git_wrap.sh" as GitWrap
participant "Bare Repo" as BareRepo
participant "post-receive" as Hook
participant "Work Tree" as WorkTree
participant "Redis Queue" as Redis
participant "Deploy Worker" as Worker
participant "Docker Build" as Docker
participant "Container" as Container
participant "Nginx" as Nginx
participant "Production Site" as Site

== User Makes Changes ==

User -> LocalGit: Edit files\n(astro.config, pages, etc.)
User -> LocalGit: git add .
User -> LocalGit: git commit -m "changes"

== Push to Server ==

User -> LocalGit: git push origin main
LocalGit -> SSH: SSH connection\ngit@server
SSH -> GitWrap: Execute forced command\n(command="git_wrap.sh")

alt Repository doesn't exist
    GitWrap -> BareRepo: git init --bare
    GitWrap -> Hook: Create post-receive hook
end

GitWrap -> BareRepo: git-receive-pack\n(receive commits)

== Post-Receive Hook ==

BareRepo -> Hook: Trigger post-receive\n(oldrev newrev refname)
Hook -> Hook: Validate branch\n(main/master only)
Hook -> WorkTree: git checkout -f main
Hook -> WorkTree: Generate Dockerfile
Hook -> WorkTree: Create package.cache.json
Hook -> Redis: RPUSH deploy_queue PAGE_HASH

note right of Redis
    Push completes quickly
    Build happens async
end note

Hook --> LocalGit: Push success

== Async Deployment ==

Redis -> Worker: BLPOP deploy_queue\n(worker gets job)
Worker -> Docker: docker build\n(with BuildKit cache)
Docker -> Docker: Install dependencies\n(cached pnpm store)
Docker -> Docker: Build Astro site\n(cached .astro)
Docker -> Docker: Create nginx image

Worker -> Container: Stop old container
Worker -> Container: docker run new container\n(port from registry)
Worker -> Registry: Update registry.json\n(port mapping)
Worker -> Nginx: Create config file\n/etc/nginx/sites-available/deploy/PAGE_HASH.conf
Worker -> Nginx: nginx -t && reload

== Site Available ==

Nginx -> Site: Proxy requests\nhttps://DOMAIN/PAGE_HASH/
Site -> User: Preview new version

Worker -> Redis: LPUSH deploy:notify\n(deployment status JSON)
Worker -> Logs: Write to deploy.log

@enduml
